<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Multibras begun as neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Multibras begun as neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it has initiated coverage of Multibras, Latin America's largest appliance manufacturer, with a neutral rating for both intermediate and long-term investors.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage said in a report that Multibras &quot;is forecast to report declining earnings in 1998 as a result of slower growth in appliance sales and probable price compression as new products enter the market.&quot;</p>
</text>
